        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"model\": \"qwen3-coder:480b-cloud\",\n  \"prompt\": \"Generate a creative social media post idea about [YOUR NICHE]. Give me: 1) A detailed image prompt for Stable Diffusion 2) An Instagram caption with hashtags 3) A Facebook post description. Format as JSON with keys: image_prompt, instagram_caption, facebook_description\",\n  \"stream\": false\n}",
